{"name": "Timebound", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/2a5f6d376b9d7c018c6ad479f870707a.avif?t=1780428114\" width=\"954\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"204\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/de4c578951be40a4b33d8470cd9932e3.poster.avif?t=1780428114\" width=\"608\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/de4c578951be40a4b33d8470cd9932e3.webm?t=1780428114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/de4c578951be40a4b33d8470cd9932e3.mp4?t=1780428114\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some parts of the world are enchanted with timeloop magic. After several steps, you'll be sent back to where you entered. Discover the rules of the world and see how far they can take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/5f758a0748be9fbdb53a6f432b23c58f.avif?t=1780428114\" width=\"954\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"204\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/4c4c0da3c4e9edfe40a9536183afdfc1.poster.avif?t=1780428114\" width=\"608\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/4c4c0da3c4e9edfe40a9536183afdfc1.webm?t=1780428114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/4c4c0da3c4e9edfe40a9536183afdfc1.mp4?t=1780428114\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every puzzle is handcrafted to teach you a new rule about the world. There's no filler or chores, just a pure rule-discovery metroidBRAINIA experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"120\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/e4f802058af36b8acd4e230623f5c60e.avif?t=1780428114\" width=\"954\"/></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"204\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/5d7bb76338c472a9bc1460d2a88e2f08.poster.avif?t=1780428114\" width=\"608\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/5d7bb76338c472a9bc1460d2a88e2f08.webm?t=1780428114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/5d7bb76338c472a9bc1460d2a88e2f08.mp4?t=1780428114\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your progress is only limited by your knowledge, not by artificial unlocks. What seemed impossible before might just need a second look. Yes, you could have done that the entire time!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Puzzle Design</strong> -  Solve puzzles by manipulating local timeloops in creative ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Knowledge-based Progression </strong> - Explore a world where your only limit is what you know.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Secrets &amp; meta puzzles</strong> - Think outside the box to solve layered, interconnected puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Play at your own pace</strong> -\u00a0Use the interactive hints, restart the puzzle whenever you want, save and load the game at any time.</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "An exploration puzzle adventure in mystical ruins. Explore a world filled with puzzles, uncover the magic left behind, discover what's hidden in plain sight, learn the rules and break them.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/1413b315711affc3993acdfd5fee4957eea33b13/header.jpg?t=1780428114", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Puzzle", "Logic", "Time Manipulation", "Difficult", "Exploration", "Mystery"], "developers": "Michal Kluz, Patrycja Sagan, Fabien Calabria", "publishers": "Michal Kluz, Patrycja Sagan, Fabien Calabria", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3220700", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "5 February 2026 - Request Access\n\n28 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/0NmrYzFEfr0", "first_seen": 1770246000.0, "review_rank": 1272}